# .trivyignore - Trivy Ignore List

This file documents Trivy misconfiguration IDs that are intentionally ignored for this project.

## AVD-AZU-0012: Documented false positive

AVD-AZU-0012
<https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/azure/storage/avd-azu-0012/>
This project does not define or manage any Azure infrastructure resources, this is clearly a false positive.
